# Helium Rapid DSL MCP server

## Entry point

- Compiled entry point is `helium-rapid-dsl-mcp/out/src/index.js` (not `out/index.js`).

## Cursor MCP registration guidance

- Cursor does not support `lm.registerMcpServerDefinitionProvider`.
- Register bundled MCP using `vscode.cursor.mcp.registerServer(...)`.
- Prefer HTTP+SSE MCP transport (`server.url`) from a spawned local process.

## Dependency coupling

- Prefer stable imports from `helium-dsl-language-server/api`.
- Avoid deep imports from language server compiled internals unless unavoidable.

## Runtime compatibility

- Keep ESM imports compatible with strict Node runtime expectations used by Cursor.
